"/arc-plc/texas/victoria-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 42 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 46% of normal in September to October and 32% in October to November. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 161% and May to June at 156% on the middle of the grids. Grid 10033 had its driest year in 2011 at 40% of normal.</p>"}
